ttp://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/base/topics/function&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388866788000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01hdOi5Tb_hK_dM5b8MCyz\"><span><span>return</span></span></a></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>NULL</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span>\r\n  <span><span><span>}</span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></code></pre><br>Now, adding the in read.csv(), is the file actually being read twice? Is it first being read in and then subsequently formatted according to read.csv?<br><br><pre><code><span><span><span>output</span></span></span><span><span><span>$</span></span></span><span><span><span>contents</span></span></span> <span><span><span>&lt;-</span></span></span> <span><a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/renderTable.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/renderTable.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388866788000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U_11OlsLhQLdTUUvQVjO7\"><span><span>renderTable</span></span></a></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span><span>{</span></span></span>\r\n    <span><span><span>inFile</span></span></span> <span><span><span>&lt;-</span></span></span> <span><span><span>input</span></span></span><span><span><span>$</span></span></span><span><span><span>file1</span></span></span>\r\n <span><span><span>if</span></span></span> <span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><a href=\"http://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/base/topics/NULL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/base/topics/NULL&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388866788000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zhUt5aikib3k5pxbHmMaU\"><span><span>is.null</span></span></a></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span><span>inFile</span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><spa